    "handle": "wild-gambler-rigin",
    "title": "Wild Gambler Rigin",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The WILD GAMBLER RIGIN was developed through extensive offshore and inshore testing over a long period, with a particular emphasis on repeated adjustments to the cup. This process resulted in a finely tuned sound, bubble action, and maximum casting distance.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">This popper is perfect for GTs. The sweet, enticing sound, compact body, and bubbles work together to obscure the silhouette. This combination makes even pressure-sensitive large GTs unable to resist, prompting them to leap out and strike.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Length 180 mm - Gr. 135</p></li><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Length 160 mm - Gr. 105</p></li></ul>",
